Description: Network Suffix - product contexts derive in this network's namespace
Network: ../zombienet-configs/local-dev.toml
Creds: config

# The suffix used to be a runtime constant baked into the WASM; it now lives in a pallet
# that genesis sets, so `ppn generate` writes the descriptor's value over the `paseo` the
# presets ship. Both runtimes that carry the pallet are checked.

# ============================================
# Prerequisites
# ============================================

people-collator1: is up
asset-hub-collator1: is up

alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1502 is registered within 400 seconds
alice-paseo-validator: parachain 1500 is registered within 400 seconds

# ============================================
# Suffix Tests
# ============================================

people-collator1: js-script ./scripts/dist/test-network-suffix.js return is equal to 1 within 120 seconds
asset-hub-collator1: js-script ./scripts/dist/test-network-suffix.js return is equal to 1 within 120 seconds
